		"readmeComment": "Use the `clean_rooms` channel with comma separated room ids to clean specific rooms. The Mi Robot Vacuum-Mop 2 Pro (ijai.vacuum.v3) can stop the map upload to the Xiaomi cloud with the command `set_properties[{\"did\":\"map_uploads\",\"siid\":10,\"piid\":23,\"value\":1}]` on the `actions#commands` channel (value 0 enables it again). Stopping the map upload deactivates the map functions and clears the map data, so it is not offered as a channel. Resetting the map deletes the saved map with its rooms and zones, so it is not offered as an action either; send `action{\"did\":\"actions\",\"siid\":10,\"aiid\":10,\"in\":[]}` on the `actions#commands` channel to do it.",
		"experimental": false
	}
